<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>wgpu-lab samples</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 32px 16px; background: #141416; color: #ddd; font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }
    main { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }
    h1 { font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 4px; }
    p { color: #aaa; margin: 0 0 24px; }
    a { color: #8ab4ff; }
    .gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
    .gallery a { display: block; background: #1e1e22; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; text-decoration: none; color: #ddd; }
    .gallery a:hover { background: #2a2a30; }
    .gallery img, .gallery .blank { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; background: #0c0c0e; }
    .gallery span { display: block; padding: 8px 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>wgpu-lab samples</h1>
    <p>The <a href="https://github.com/bv7dev/wgpu-lab">wgpu-lab</a> samples, running in the browser through WebGPU.
       The same C++ source renders natively on the desktop.</p>
    <div class="gallery">
@LAB_GALLERY_ITEMS@    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
